      "about": {
        "title": ["Private systems need", "software people run", "themselves."],
        "paragraphs": [
          [
            "Most apps run on someone else's server.",
            "That server sees who you are, what you do,",
            "and who you talk to."
          ],
          [
            "Basecamp moves that work back under your control.",
            "Your keys, data, and activity stay on your machine.",
            "You are the infrastructure."
